        prompts: {
          human: 'Twenty-Two (also known as 22) is a trick-taking card game where the winner of the last trick is penalised. Players try to avoid taking the final trick; the losing card is kept as penalty points (Aces 11, face cards 10, others face value). First player to reach 22 or more points is eliminated; last player remaining wins. Suits are irrelevant; cards rank A-K-Q-J-10-9-8-7-6-5-4-3-2.',
