        scoring: {
          description: 'Aces 11, pictures 10, other cards face value. Loser of each hand keeps their card face up; total is their score. 22+ points = eliminated (after dealing the next hand). If all remaining players eliminated in same hand, agree to treat all as winners or award to lowest total.',
